   Command: `npx vitest run packages/core/test/checkpoint.doltRepo.test.ts`
   Expected: with dolt → 2 passed; without dolt → 1 passed, 1 skipped.

6. Typecheck.
   Command: `npm run build`
   Expected: exit 0.

7. Commit.
   Command: `git add -A && git commit -m "feat(e8): DoltRepo CLI wrapper (init/apply/commit/log)"`
